        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DFT150SMTBR, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Retro Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Driftless Door Pull is made out of 1-1/2 inch brass tubing. It features retro styled door mounts. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. This 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Retro Door Pull is available in a huge selection of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Retro Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DFT01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262335\"><b>First Impressions DFT150SMTBR Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DFT150018SMTBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DFT150024SMTBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DFT150036SMTBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 28\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
